        "title": "Expert Backed Review Summary",
        "text": "<p>NAKED Energy is a practical option for men and women looking for a relatively simple pre-workout formula without the long list of artificial flavors, colors, and sweeteners found in many conventional products. Its unflavored design also makes it easy to mix into water, smoothies, or other workout drinks without adding a strong flavor. The formula centers around several familiar performance-focused ingredients. Each serving provides 200 mg of caffeine sourced from coffee beans, along with 2 g of CarnoSyn® beta-alanine, 1 g of creatine, and 1 g of AjiPure® L-arginine. It also contains vitamin C, B vitamins, folate, and calcium. The combination is intended to support energy, strength, power, stamina, and focus during training. One of the product's main advantages is its minimalist approach. The unflavored version contains 10 listed ingredients and is made without artificial sweeteners, flavors, or colors. It's also vegan, uses non-GMO ingredients, and is NSF Certified for contents, adding another level of quality assurance for people who pay close attention to what's in their supplements. </p><p></p>",
